": "Choose a place in your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give your partner directions to get there using public transportation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell them what they can see and do there."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about places in my city."}, {"type": "text", "content": " I communicate the location of a place. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give directions for public transportation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions for things to see and do."}]}], "type": "sena"}